      "summaries": {
        "en": "NewPipe is an open-source Android app that provides private, ad-free access to streaming platforms like YouTube without requiring Google services. It works by directly parsing video metadata from websites, enabling features like background playback and local downloads while respecting user privacy. Developers can extend its functionality by adding parsers for new platforms, and users can enjoy a cleaner viewing experience or integrate it into custom media workflows.",
        "zh": "NewPipe是一款开源Android应用，作为轻量级流媒体前端，它让用户无需Google服务即可私密、无广告地访问YouTube等平台。其核心技术是通过直接解析网站视频元数据实现播放，支持后台播放和本地下载，同时保护用户隐私。开发者可通过添加新平台解析器来扩展功能，用户则可享受更干净的观看体验，或将其集成到自定义媒体工作流中，探索去中心化内容消费的可能性。",
        "es": "NewPipe is an open-source Android app that provides private, ad-free access to streaming platforms like YouTube without requiring Google services. It works by directly parsing video metadata from websites, enabling features like background playback and local downloads while respecting user privacy. Developers can extend its functionality by adding parsers for new platforms, and users can enjoy a cleaner viewing experience or integrate it into custom media workflows.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "NewPipe stands out for 4k, android, and bandcamp in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "NewPipe is an open-source Android app that provides private, ad-free access to streaming platforms like YouTube without requiring Google services. It works by directly parsing video metadata from websites, enabling features like background playback and local downloads while respecting user privacy. Developers can extend its functionality by adding parsers for new platforms, and users can enjoy a cleaner viewing experience or integrate it into custom media workflows.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/TeamNewPipe/NewPipe for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
