      "summaries": {
        "en": "Playwright CLI is a command-line tool that simplifies browser automation by providing ready-to-use commands for common Playwright tasks, eliminating the need to write boilerplate code. Its standout feature is the ability to record user interactions and automatically generate clean Playwright scripts, making automation accessible even to those new to browser testing. Developers can use it to quickly capture screenshots, inspect page elements for selectors, or generate test scripts from recordings, streamlining workflows for web scraping, UI testing, or accessibility audits.",
        "zh": "Playwright CLI 是一个命令行工具，旨在简化浏览器自动化流程，通过提供即用型命令来处理常见的 Playwright 操作，省去了编写模板代码的麻烦。其核心亮点在于能够录制用户交互并自动生成简洁的 Playwright 脚本，这使得自动化测试对新手也更加友好。开发者可以用它快速截取网页截图、检查页面元素以获取选择器，或从录制内容生成测试脚本，从而高效支持网页抓取、界面测试或无障碍检测等实际应用场景。",
        "es": "Playwright CLI is a command-line tool that simplifies browser automation by providing ready-to-use commands for common Playwright tasks, eliminating the need to write boilerplate code. Its standout feature is the ability to record user interactions and automatically generate clean Playwright scripts, making automation accessible even to those new to browser testing. Developers can use it to quickly capture screenshots, inspect page elements for selectors, or generate test scripts from recordings, streamlining workflows for web scraping, UI testing, or accessibility audits.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "playwright-cli stands out for playwright in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Playwright CLI is a command-line tool that simplifies browser automation by providing ready-to-use commands for common Playwright tasks, eliminating the need to write boilerplate code. Its standout feature is the ability to record user interactions and automatically generate clean Playwright scripts, making automation accessible even to those new to browser testing. Developers can use it to quickly capture screenshots, inspect page elements for selectors, or generate test scripts from recordings, streamlining workflows for web scraping, UI testing, or accessibility audits.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/microsoft/playwright-cli for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
