        "es": "OpenCode Anthropic Auth is a JavaScript library that simplifies authentication for Claude API integration, addressing the complexity of managing API keys and authentication flows in web applications. It provides a clean abstraction layer with built-in error handling and token management, making API interactions more reliable. Developers can integrate it into Node.js backends or frontend frameworks to quickly add Claude-powered features while maintaining security best practices.",
